# Experience Update
# Opcode: 0x3056
# Format: monsterId (int) + currentExp (int) + previousExp (int) + currentSP (int) + previousSP (int)
# monsterId: 12345 (0x00003039)
# currentExp: 50000 (0x0000C350)
# previousExp: 40000 (0x00009C40)
# currentSP: 1000 (0x000003E8)
# previousSP: 800 (0x00000320)
